          en: 'On transmission and brake components, fuel caps and VIN plates a 2D Data Matrix carries the serial and the batch number. The code is tied to the part’s history: if a defect surfaces later, the affected batch can be identified and only that batch has to be recalled, not the whole production run. The marker is not a standalone machine here — it sits in a robot cell or a PLC-controlled line and receives from there what to write on the next part.',
