          en: 'A packaging line does not stop for labelling: the applicator has to place the label on the product as it moves past, continuously. Volumes are high and cycle times short, so application accuracy and how fast a roll changes over decide how much output is actually lost. Where there is little room beside the conveyor, the size of the applicator matters too.', us: 'A packaging line does not stop for labeling: the applicator has to place the label on the product as it moves past, continuously. Volumes are high and cycle times short, so application accuracy and how fast a roll changes over decide how much output is actually lost. Where there is little room beside the conveyor, the size of the applicator matters too.',
          de: 'Die Verpackungslinie hält fürs Etikettieren nicht an: Der Etikettierkopf muss das Etikett auf das laufende Produkt bringen, ohne Unterbrechung. Die Stückzahlen sind hoch, die Taktzeit ist kurz — wie viel Ausbringung tatsächlich verloren geht, entscheiden Aufbringgenauigkeit und Rollenwechselzeit. Wo neben dem Band wenig Platz ist, zählt auch die Baugröße des Kopfes.',
          it: 'La linea di confezionamento non si ferma per etichettare: la testa deve applicare l’etichetta sul prodotto in movimento, senza interruzioni. I volumi sono alti e il tempo ciclo breve, quindi la precisione di applicazione e la rapidità del cambio bobina decidono quanta produzione si perde davvero. Dove lo spazio a bordo nastro è poco, conta anche l’ingombro della testa.',
